{"key":"variable-window-5a0783e3e5ae5980","sourceHash":"5a0783e3e5ae5980f66b2e83c96fd30a24957a4caa79bd6e0e96ffd51fd4f641","pattern":"variable-window","category":"sliding-window","title":"Challenge: Variable-Size Window","idea":"Expand until a constraint fails, then shrink until it is valid again.","complexity":"O(n) time · O(1) or state space","source":"fn shortest_sum(values: &[i32], target: i32) -> usize {\n    assert!(values.iter().all(|&x| x > 0));\n    let (mut left, mut sum, mut best) = (0, 0, usize::MAX);\n    for (right, &x) in values.iter().enumerate() {\n        sum += x;\n        while sum >= target {\n            best = best.min(right - left + 1);\n            sum -= values[left];\n            left += 1;\n        }\n    }\n    if best == usize::MAX { 0 } else { best }\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let result = shortest_sum(&[7], 7).to_string();\n    println!(\"{result}\");\n}\n","sites":[{"line":2,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"assert!(values.iter().all(|&x| x > 0));"},{"line":3,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"let (mut left, mut sum, mut best) = (0, 0, usize::MAX);"},{"line":4,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"for (right, &x) in values.iter().enumerate() {"},{"line":5,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"sum += x;"},{"line":6,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"while sum >= target {"},{"line":7,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"best = best.min(right - left + 1);"},{"line":8,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"sum -= values[left];"},{"line":9,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"left += 1;"},{"line":10,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"}"},{"line":12,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"if best == usize::MAX { 0 } else { best }"},{"line":12,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"0"},{"line":12,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"best"},{"line":16,"function":"main","statement":"let result = shortest_sum(&[7], 7).to_string();"},{"line":17,"function":"main","statement":"println!(\"{result}\");"},{"line":18,"function":"main","statement":"}"}],"version":1,"input":"[7]","stdout":"1\n","values":[{"type":"&[i32]","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"7"}],"tuple":false}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"7"}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"0"}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"0"}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"18446744073709551615"}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}},{"type":"alloc::string::String","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"\"1\""}}],"frames":[{"site":12,"stack":[["main",1]],"locals":[]},{"site":0,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1]]},{"site":1,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1]]},{"site":2,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1],["left",2],["sum",3],["best",4]]},{"site":3,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1],["left",2],["sum",3],["best",4],["right",2],["x",1]]},{"site":4,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1],["left",2],["sum",1],["best",4],["right",2],["x",1]]},{"site":5,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1],["left",2],["sum",1],["best",4],["right",2],["x",1]]},{"site":6,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1],["left",2],["sum",1],["best",5],["right",2],["x",1]]},{"site":7,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1],["left",2],["sum",3],["best",5],["right",2],["x",1]]},{"site":8,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1],["left",5],["sum",3],["best",5],["right",2],["x",1]]},{"site":9,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1],["left",5],["sum",3],["best",5]]},{"site":11,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1],["left",5],["sum",3],["best",5]]},{"site":13,"stack":[["main",1]],"locals":[["res